{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_014_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:66fec0f76dc7413574aeed9e8f48245ec24ccf0d1c9c8f592f2e9d4ab4c73319",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a16d99ff92b112d3e3122695089a7569eddd98199ac503185d962f2f697f500",
      "text": "今年的蛋糕也是大家一起烤的。\n如果不介意的话请尝尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4358e19f3772ca3934c57261a3fb8b37951e410887d8119a89dbbceb14cea531",
      "text": "我不小心烤焦的地方，也被诚司先生\n巧妙地补救了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:989149075fd4da6956b3b0b1ce283fc9416827b0fc7cef4daa9c569b6e6174c3",
      "text": "哈哈，说出来不就穿帮了嘛。\n不过真好吃啊，某种意义上这也算是美食探店的工作了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4742cae524736ce3c9442d9e7f346f9fb43c0a1ca8e90010a4e711380910862",
      "text": "那么请务必来一段美食点评！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:096fadba9e67ecf2b8cd4ccfc00e408d5fab4b93dfc6b70cf81af27f249cea40",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧……怎么说呢……\n光是吃下去就能让人超级幸福，最棒的蛋糕了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:736f3eb32bb03e7be4c565a859dbad415d136be303257ca312f9e631729f2fe8",
      "text": "哈哈。谢谢。对了，礼物也\n准备好了。那边的评价也拜托了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee507ecff97fea6a6a59bc499386b19535d2680d10d9a1f12a07347d28ce644e",
      "text": "哇，不知不觉观看人数和评论数都这么多了！\n英雄先生，也读一读评论吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01d20eb2ddddce7c4cedabec6cd91f512d9aa82f1e85c9e4d5c12e483524e00b",
      "text": "我看看……“超祝生快！”\n噢，超3Q？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02cafa1f65f5ca5e2b966eb59e6ba1b916902987e90a7bab37c9c65b9b192027",
      "text": "接下来是……“看到特别直播就觉得绝对是英雄生诞！”\n太厉害了，我可是完全没注意到啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7b8cce284cf219c87966df166397daadf600f3bcc1f2f5523c18b76bcd1c56b",
      "text": "……在屏幕对面能得到这么多粉丝的\n祝福，真的很幸福。谢谢大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc8626166bb602fcb107bb979c091f6d21ce30caae10bc6aad6ac24a67278533",
      "text": "这份谢意，就用今后的工作来报答各位吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f8a3716e37d0a9ad503014a2ec1149fbf204aaa8dacf131282ec3d4f016ff09",
      "text": "我也是同样的想法。\n而且我认为只要在这个组合里就能实现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9df99c9204bf6f21de1ad585b754743452fb023d27f8625a0075ed234cdc5bd5",
      "text": "我也是！\n今后三人也齐心协力一起努力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_e:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a4188ecf05d683983f5a1d00f8182f93ee97ff589cfdf26a8279ee9e55be11",
      "text": "噢。\nFRAME的三个人，一起齐心协力加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
